<title>POLAND: AGROS SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>AGROS SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.87 vs   3.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.61 vs   6.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.41 vs   7.31</p>
<p> Sales		  144.34 vs  89.84</p>
